SHAWZIFY is an independent fan-made tool and is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Digital Extremes. Warframe and Shawzin are trademarks of Digital Extremes Ltd.

The Shawzin scale, chord and format tables in
engine/shawzify_engine/shawzin/data/ describe publicly documented behaviour of a
video game feature. They were cross-checked against the MIT-licensed projects
credited in docs/research/existing-tools.md. No game assets are included.
